=2 Walkthrough
!Toraimarai Canal-map2.jpg|right|Toraimarai Map 2
!Toraimarai Canal-map1.jpg|right|Toraimarai Map 1
Trade enough {p:Crystals} to the {p:Conquest NPC} to raise your Rank bar and unlock the Mission, then accept it from the {n:Gate Guard}.
* Talk to {n:Tosuka-Porika} in the **Optistery** eastern building in {z:Windurst Waters} HP #1 (G-8) for a cutscene and to receive the {@k} {k:Optistery ring}.
* Head to {z:Toraimarai Canal} (G-8) Map 2 and defeat the 4 {m:Hinge Oils|Hinge Oil} in the room.
** Quickest way to get there is to enter through the {z:Windurst Walls} (I-3) **Priming Gate** using the {@k} {k:Rhinostery certificate}, take a right at the bottom of the stairs, get into the water and keep turning left until you reach some stairs, which you should go up. From here, head south > east > north to reach the Slimes in (G-8).
** Alternatively if you have the {p:Home Point} #1 of {z:Toraimarai Canal}, go south from it entering a big room, continue towards your left to exit the room and begin walking through the canals. On Map 1 of the canals stay on the above path and walk towards point **B**. Once you reach point **B** on the above section keep going north on the only path and go down in the water section of the canals, go back to B and cross into Map 2, take a first right and go south, at the first stairs go up to the raised path and go towards (G-8) where you will find the oozes and door.
* After defeating the 4 {m:Slimes|Slime}, head northeast to the stairs at (H-8) and examine the **Marble Door** at the top.
** All four {m:Hinge Oils|Hinge Oil} must be defeated before you can enter **The Animastery**. {m:Hinge Oils|Hinge Oil} will repop after 16 minutes.
* Examine the **Tome of Magic** lying on the ground to begin a cutscene.
** This is near the desk and a skull resting on a chair.

Return to {n:Tosuka-Porika} to complete the Mission. You will receive the {@k} {k:Blank Book of the Gods}.
